## Interface: 120100
## Title: XayaUI Platform
## Notes: Xaya's personal UI toolkit: the platform every XayaUI addon runs on (settings, theme, sharing, Recycle Bin, profiles, sounds and media lists, the error record, minimap and game menu buttons). Rule-based cues and combat aura tracking (Rules), the settings window (Options) and the debug tools (Debug: console window, bug and debug reports, loaded only while Settings > Debugging > Advanced Debugging is on) are separate entries you can switch on or off. Commands: /xui, /xayaui
